This action will involve public and private entities committed to achieving the objectives of a strategy guided by a task force established at the Ministry of Economy, Industry and Trade (MiSE) and in direct relation with the indications of the European Union and with the NextGenerationEU strategy. We will monitor numerous interventions carried out in the field to identify areas of strength and weakness, where necessary, to implement corrective or strengthening actions. In parallel, new actions and programmes will be launched for:
• aiming to introduce innovation and businesses more effectively into schools;
• launching the Startup competition both in schools and at universities;
• creating training modules dedicated to small enterprises to facilitate their access to digital technologies;
• strengthening 4.0 education;
• bringing digital businesses closer to traditional businesses through joint projects;
• establishing an Italian Centre for Artificial Intelligence.

Finally, we will strengthen collaborations:
• between central administrations, in order to develop, each within its competence, more coordinated actions and measures both on the operational level and on the monitoring and evaluation level

