One of the main tools for enhancing students' digital competencies is the National Digital School Plan (PNSD). The plan consists of 35 actions divided into four intervention areas:
1. Tools: Finalized actions to equip new schools with learning environments based on new digital technologies, where innovative teaching methodologies can be experimented with and implemented;
2. Competences and contents: Finalized actions to promote and enhance students' digital competencies and to foster the development of high-quality digital didactic content;
