– strengthening and integrating specialist competences in the fields of informatics and engineering (including science, big data, artificial intelligence, cloud computing, cybersecurity, software development, system architecture), statistics, modelling, and management technologies to support digital transformation and Industry 4.0 (Internet of Things, embedded systems for the integration of Informatics, Telecommunications, and Electronics technologies), robotics, high-performance computing applications, connectivity, services science, technological system management, and their integration into production systems and public administration;  
