2.1 Vision and Objectives
The National Strategy for Digital Competence, Italy 2025 | 14 outlines a clear horizon for the challenge "Inclusive and Sustainable Development": work for ethical, inclusive, transparent and sustainable innovation that increases societal well-being. This means operating so that:
• digital capabilities of people are strengthened;
• the State guarantees technological development that is ethical, responsible and non-discriminatory;
• citizens are trained to access future jobs through a continuous training process.
Digital Republic, the national strategic initiative for digital competence, is the soul of this challenge. Digital competencies constitute a fundamental strategic axis for social and economic growth, which is only possible if three conditions of sustainable evolution are realized, with system interventions that are detailed in the following:
• the population gains increasing digital awareness and thus succeeds in maximizing the benefits of the digital by directing an "ethical" evolution of the use of technologies and their social enjoyment;

